WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,240
When I first selected the Gods

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:03,200
It was Patriarch Haoran who gave up his position as a god.

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,240
Gave it to Yaotian Sect

4
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,720
I didn't expect it to be a white-eyed wolf

5
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:06,960
what did you say

6
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:10,390
People are getting older

7
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:11,390
Didn't hear clearly

8
00:00:11,390 --> 00:00:12,390
Something big

9
00:00:12,830 --> 00:00:16,670
I said you are white-eyed wolves

10
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:19,220
My sect disciple said it wrong

11
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:22,420
The old clan is kind enough to give you the position of the God clan.

12
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:23,660
Forget it if you don’t thank me

13
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:25,180
Targeting Haoran Sect everywhere

14
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:26,980
He even wanted to bring Haoran Sect

15
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:29,020
Merge into your Yaotian Clan

16
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:30,820
My conscience was eaten by a dog

17
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:32,540
None of your elders are here

18
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:34,140
Who gave you the courage?

19
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:36,380
Dare you talk to the Yaotian Divine Clan like this?

20
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:40,700
Something happened to my Haoran clan father

21
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:42,900
It's really easy to bully
